# No `for...of`

Do not use `for (const x of …)` in application code.

Prefer:

- `.map` / `.filter` / `.reduce`
- `Array.from(map, …)` / `Object.entries` / `Object.groupBy` (when lib target allows)

```ts
// ❌
for (const skill of skills) {
  …
}

// ✅
skills.reduce((acc, skill) => {
  …
  return acc;
}, new Map());
```

Exceptions: generated code, rare low-level loops where a reduce would obscure control flow — call out in review.
